<body>
<div class="min-h-screen bg-gray-darkish text-white flex flex-col justify-center items-center relative py-8">
    <!-- Main content -->
    <div class="text-center px-4 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center items-center">
        <h1 class="font-bold font-semibold italic leading-[0.8]">
            <!-- Mobile version (stacked) -->
            <div class="block md:hidden">
                <div class="text-[20vw] leading-[0.8]">you’re</div>&nbsp;
                <div class="text-[20vw] leading-[0.8]">lost</div>
            </div>
            <!-- Desktop version (single line) -->
            <div class="hidden md:block text-[10vw] leading-[0.8]">you’re lost.</div>
        </h1>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl 2xl:text-5xl font-medium italic mt-8">This is a 404 page. You have arrived here in error.<br/><br/> Here’s a poem. You’re welcome.</h2>
        <a href="https://tedium.co"><img src="/content/logo_v3.svg" alt="Tedium logo" class="max-w-[300px] mt-12"></a>
        <p class="text-sm font-bold">The Dull Side of the Internet.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom tease -->
    <div class="w-full">
        <bottom-tease class="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3 m-auto align-bottom py-10 px-4">
            <p class="text-center text-2xl text-white font-semibold">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-down-long"></i>&nbsp;
                <i>Read the poem.</i>&nbsp;
                <i class="fa-solid fa-down-long"></i>
            </p> 
        </bottom-tease>
    </div>
</div>
<innercontent class="">
    <innergrid>
        <article class="thank-you">
            <content class="text-center italic">

      <p class="md:text-xl lg:text-2xl 2xl:text-3xl !leading-[2]">Long before the Large Hadron Collider<br />
        Became CERN’s calling card of sorts<br />
        A young British man of sizable smarts<br />
        Walked into a French lab, with a hypertext heart</p>
        <p>&nbsp;</p>
        <p class="md:text-xl lg:text-2xl 2xl:text-3xl !leading-[2]">Tim-Berners Lee, the internet’s idea man<br />
        Couldn’t have seen the endless array of sites<br />
        But one big thing <a href="https://twitter.com/timberners_lee/status/5342876032">he clearly prepared for</a><br />
        Was what might happen if a link breaks or dies  </p>
        <p>&nbsp;</p>
        <p class="md:text-xl lg:text-2xl 2xl:text-3xl !leading-[2]">There are 404 reasons you might see this page<br />
        But the biggest one helped Tim set the stage<br />
        For you to enter the door<br />
        Even if you got there by mistake.</p>
        <p>&nbsp;</p>
        <p class="md:text-xl lg:text-2xl 2xl:text-3xl !leading-[2]">Welcome to <a href="http://www.room404.com/page.php?pg=homepage">CERN room 404</a>.</p>
        <p class="md:text-xl lg:text-2xl 2xl:text-3xl !leading-[2]"><em>— Ernest J. Smith, Esq.</em></p>
            </content>
                <form action="/search/" method="get" role="search">
