            <footeroutro>
            <footerblurb><strong>Once upon a time,</strong> there was an internet that was weird and fascinating and didn’t make you mad. Since 2015, Tedium has tried to bring that internet back through a commitment to weirdness and a love for the obscure and offbeat. We are nominally a newsletter, but if you share our content on the web, we won’t be upset. But if you email us asking for a backlink, we’ll publicly scold you on social media using the most sarcastic possible language. Them’s the breaks.</footerblurb>
